yaml
description: Code in the YAML language - YAML Ain't Markup Language
- >
  **YAML** is an indentation-based text format for structured data - the human-editable cousin
  of JSON. A YAML source is either one **code** - a single document - or a whole **stream** of
  documents in one file. See the subchapters below for the two:
- *: 00-yaml_stream
- *: 01-yaml_code
